# Netlify-native redirects - if hosting on Netlify, prefer this file over
# astro.config.mjs `redirects` for URL migrations. This produces a true
# server-level 301, which is a cleaner signal than the meta-refresh page
# Astro generates in static mode. Not used if hosting on Vercel - use
# vercel.json's `redirects` array instead (see README).
#
# Format: /old-path  /new-path  301
#
# /blog/2021/05/spring-lawn-tips  /blog/spring-lawn-prep-tips  301
# /services/sprinkler-repair-huntington-ny  /huntington-sprinkler-repair  301
